# Copy to `.env` and fill in. `.env` is gitignored; this file must never hold a real value.
#
# Only the key is here. **The model id and base URL are written literally in `agent.yaml`**,
# because only secrets go behind `${VAR}` — a model name is not a secret, and behind a variable it
# makes every listing show `${MODEL_ID}` and every stray `.env` on the machine able to change which
# model this agent runs on.
#
# So the sharp edge is the pairing: the key below has to belong to the provider `agent.yaml` names.
# A DeepSeek key against the generated OpenAI `baseUrl` is a `401` reported against a container
# that is otherwise working perfectly — verified, and it is the first thing to check.
MODEL_API_KEY=
